SUMMARY:Foes of a Minimum Wage Guard
LOCATION:CitySpace\, 43 Main St\, Easthampton\, MA 01027
DESCRIPTION:Pay it Forward 2026\nFoes of a Minimum Wage Guard- A Solo Play\
 , January 8 & 9 Pay it Forward Foes of a Minimum Wage Guard is an award-wi
 nning solo comedy-drama play in which a 68-year-old retail worker is sudde
 nly reassigned to loss prevention without training and must protect a stru
 ggling department store—or risk losing his job. Performed by Ken Harris 
 portraying 12 different characters\, the play explores workplace pressure\
 , resilience\, and the search for dignity through humor\, suspense\, and h
 eartfelt storytelling.\nhttps://tickets.venuepilot.com/e/cityspace-present
 s-quarters-in-the-water-2027-01-08-cityspace-easthampton-e17126\nFrom Push
 pin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://tickets.venuepilot.com/e/cityspace-presents-quarters-in-the-wat
 er-2027-01-08-cityspace-easthampton-e17126
END:VEVENT
